  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Contributing to social cohesion efforts in the Far North, North-West and South-West Regions</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project&#x2019;s overall goal is to contribute to social cohesion efforts in the Far North, North-West and South-West regions of Cameroon. Reconstruction in North-West and South-West Region and stabilization intervention in the Far North contributes to improve security and livelihood in these affected regions. However, there are still many needs in terms of support for social cohesion and peacebuilding. The project will contribute to restore trust and strengthen community resilience and the capacit</narrative>
  </description>
